          "title": "You'll want to know: यंत्र",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यंत्र — yantra — \"a machine\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "हे यंत्र विजेवर चालतं. he yantra vijevar cāltaṁ. This machine runs on electricity."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter."
