          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यंत्र (yantra) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit yantra, \"an instrument, a machine\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
